173 0 obj
<</AP<</N 218 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 3 0 R /Rect[ 108.942 268.134 535.59 418.743]/Subtype/Widget/T(q1)/Type/Annot/V(It is critical to run a penetration test as it helps uphold the pillars of cybersecurity: confidentiality, integrity, and availability. With a penetration test, it assesses if a website is capable of upholding those three. This is absolutely necessary as this website might hold customer's vital data and as well as hundreds of payment information through e-commerce, such as credit card, login data, PII.)>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<</AP<</N 220 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 3 0 R /Rect[ 108.942 63.8049 535.591 247.723]/Subtype/Widget/T(q2)/Type/Annot/V(What a cross-site scripting attack is type of injection attack that hackers use to input malicious code through a website, and modifying or extracting data on the website, and then the users would unconsciously execute the code, allowing it to wreck havoc onto the website through corruption and stealing user identities or site visitors. This can be done through a coding flaw of the website, using the client software as the vector.)>>
endobj
