[ 176 0 R  177 0 R  178 0 R  179 0 R ]
endobj
176 0 obj
<</AP<</N 222 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 108.198 580.937 534.846 700.088]/Subtype/Widget/T(q3)/Type/Annot/V(A reflective cross-site scripting attack is a non-persistent attack that is not as serious as its counterpart but much more common, is when the hackers use scripting onto the URL directly or by device, and try to put themselves in a position of power in the system, brute forcing thesmelves to be shown user's data or data that would be desirable for some form of gain and having privileges on the victim's server.)>>
endobj
177 0 obj
<</AP<</N 224 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 108.198 415.795 534.847 539.572]/Subtype/Widget/T(q4)/Type/Annot/V(The web application attack that would most likely extract privacy data elements out of a database is a stored cross-site scripting attack.)>>
endobj
178 0 obj
<</AP<</N 226 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 108.198 258.788 534.846 377.939]/Subtype/Widget/T(q5)/Type/Annot/V(Security countermeasures to monitor injection attacks is through the DMWA application, which is a tool that is intentionally left extremely vulnerable to aid on any changes to a server or website and see if any scripting or abnormal changes have been made in the SQL databases.)>>
endobj
179 0 obj
<</AP<</N 228 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 17 0 R /Rect[ 108.198 80.6462 534.847 204.423]/Subtype/Widget/T(q6)/Type/Annot/V(By showing how common they are, and as well the consequences if we do not take proper steps to mitigate the chances of such attacks happening. If we did not incorporate penetration tests to our web application, we would have no idea how vulnerable our website is actually is and no idea how much information could be leaking from us, as well as how many customers we have endangered. I would warn about all the exploits that can happen from cross scripting attacks and what could be injected to our scripting without any of our knowledge and how all of our most valuable data be bleeding out of company, and that does not include the legal trouble we would have from not taking enough precautions to protect our customers.)>>
endobj
